ditional product + sum of\n// delayed products, mod 2^16) -> small register-to-register critical path ->\n// short per-stage PIPE -> flat Fmax. Same as the reference.\nmodule iir8_v7 (\n  input clk, input rst_n, input [7:0] x, output reg [15:0] y\n);\n  reg [7:0] xd1;\n  reg [7:0] xd2;\n  reg [7:0] xd3;\n  reg [7:0] xd4;\n  reg [7:0] xd5;\n  reg [7:0] xd6;\n  reg [7:0] xd7;\n  reg [15:0] y2;\n  wire [15:0] acc0 = y;\n  wire [15:0] acc1 = acc0 + 25 * x;\n  wire [15:0] acc2 = acc1 + 26 * xd1;\n  wire [15:0] acc3 = acc2 + 46 * xd2;\n  wire [15:0] acc4 = acc3 + 49 * xd3;\n  wire [15:0] acc5 = acc4 + 16 * xd4;\n  wire [15:0] acc6 = acc5 + 8 * xd5;\n  wire [15:0] acc7 = acc6 + 15 * xd6 + 31"
